## Model card

- **Name:** Fledge Alpha (listed as Fledge Alpha Free on OpenCode Zen)
- **Short description:** anonymous free/trial model that appeared on OpenCode/OpenRouter around 2026-10-01 with no company claiming it; press compares it to an "unsigned painting in a gallery." No evidence it is a variant of another tracked entry.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen (`opencode/fledge-alpha`, `fledge-alpha-free` route) and OpenRouter (free/trial listing); OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions.
- **Release / knowledge:** first listed 2026-10-01 (modelcompare.dev provider table); OpenCode usage data starts 2026-08-08 for the alias; knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `opencode/fledge-alpha` / `opencode/fledge-alpha-free`; OpenRouter slug `fledge-alpha` under an "unknown" publisher namespace.
- **Context window:** 1.05M tokens total, 131K max output (modelcompare.dev, reconciled against provider docs); OpenCode data page lists context as Unknown.
- **Modalities:** text + image in; text out; tool calling yes; reasoning yes; structured output not reported; open weights no (proprietary) (modelcompare.dev).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-02):** no published per-token price; served free in practice — OpenCode data shows $0.00 total observed spend across 192B tokens and 111,347 completed sessions. Free-tier caveat: an unclaimed model has no accountable data-handling policy (The Neural Feed, 2026-10-02).
- **Architecture:** not disclosed. Origin unconfirmed; The Neural Feed (2026-10-02) reports rumors pointing at DeepSeek "just a guess for now."

